---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Thank you | Forward Health gift cards"
  description="Your Forward Health gift card has been purchased. The gift card will be delivered by email within a few minutes."
>
  <section class="bg-sage-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8 py-20 lg:py-28 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-sage-600 text-cream-50 mb-6">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-tan-600 mb-3">Payment received</p>
      <h1 class="text-charcoal font-display">Thank you.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-stone leading-relaxed">
        Your Forward Health gift card is on its way. A copy of the receipt and the gift card PDF
        will arrive in your inbox within a few minutes.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-stone leading-relaxed">
        If you chose to send it to a friend, the recipient will receive their own copy with the
        redemption code.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-sage-100 p-6 lg:p-8 text-left">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-tan-700 font-semibold mb-3">What next?</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-stone leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-sage-500"></span>
            <span>Check your email (and junk folder, just in case) for the gift card PDF.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-sage-500"></span>
            <span>Hand it over, email it on, or save it for the day.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-sage-500"></span>
            <span>When the recipient is ready, they book online or call <a href="tel:0420522558" class="text-sage-700 underline">0420 522 558</a> and quote the code at reception.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-sage-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-sage-700"
        >
          Back to home
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:hello@fwdhealth.com.au"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white border border-sage-200 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal hover:border-sage-400"
        >
          Didn't receive it? Email us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
